flowchart TB
    Lead((Research lead))
    Lead <-->|task and report| Analyst[Capability analyst<br/>splits the idea into parts]
    Lead <-->|one per part, in parallel| Scouts[Component scouts<br/>search and verify]
    Scouts -->|each find| Judge[Relevance judge<br/>blind second opinion]
    Judge -->|verdict| Lead
    Lead <-->|task and report| Projects[Project scout<br/>similar whole apps]
    Lead <-->|task and report| Reviewer[Reviewer<br/>looks for gaps]
    Lead --> Done([Finish research])